[size=6][b]EpochPact — Your timeline. Your rules.[/b][/size]
An offline toolkit for Last Epoch, now [b]inside the game[/b]: press [b]F6[/b] to open it.
No installer, no EXE, no extra programs. The whole mod is one file: [b]version.dll[/b].

[b]Version 0.1.2-dev.66 | Last Epoch 1.5.4 (Steam) | Windows x64 | Offline only[/b]

[size=5][b]Install (manual — 1 minute)[/b][/size]
[list=1]
[*]Close Last Epoch.[/*]
[*]Download the Main file and open the ZIP.[/*]
[*]Open your Last Epoch folder: in Steam, right-click [b]Last Epoch[/b] > [b]Manage[/b] > [b]Browse local files[/b]. It is the folder that contains [b]Last Epoch.exe[/b].[/*]
[*][b]Copy version.dll from the ZIP into that Last Epoch folder[/b] (next to Last Epoch.exe). If Windows asks, choose Replace.[/*]
[*]Start Last Epoch, play [b]offline[/b], load your character and press [b]F6[/b].[/*]
[/list]
That is all. Back up your offline saves before installing any mod.

[size=5][b]Uninstall[/b][/size]
Close the game and delete [b]version.dll[/b] from the Last Epoch folder. Your saves and other mods stay.

[size=5][b]Please note[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Made for [b]Last Epoch 1.5.4[/b] (1.5.3 and 1.5.2.1 work too). When the game updates, wait for a new EpochPact version.[/*]
[*][b]MelonLoader[/b] also uses a file named version.dll. If you use MelonLoader, do not install this version.[/*]
[*]Offline play only. Online play is not supported.[/*]
[*]Actions that change your save (crafting, materials, quests, Monolith, Circle of Fortune) ask you first and make a recovery backup.[/*]
[*]Coming from an older EpochPact version: just copy the new version.dll over the old one. You no longer need the EpochPact desktop app.[/*]
[*]The [b]hideout is in alpha[/b]: it works, but expect rough edges, and please tell us what you find.[/*]
[*]Quad stash tabs keep their other three quarters also in three storage tabs (folder [b]EpochPact quad[/b]), so without EpochPact you still find every item there.[/*]
[/list]

[size=5][b]What you can do (F6)[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]General:[/b] XP, gold and Ancient Bones up to 100x, item drops and rarity, Legendary Potential rolls, best-rolled Uniques, more Forging Potential on drops, idols and idol altars with more prefixes and suffixes (or always the most), more Woven Enchanter uses, movement speed, cooldowns, monster density.[/*]
[*][b]Loot & Pickup:[/b] automatic pickup, turn items your loot filter hides into shards, pick up an item you click from afar, picked-up items straight to the stash tab whose Tab Priority they match, loot filter files, recent pickups window.[/*]
[*][b]Crafting:[/b] forge costs, glyph chances, keep materials, craft corrupted items, stock materials, custom items (T8 on any affix, class-specific and corrupted affixes), new affixes on Exalted items, the Legendary Potential of your Uniques, the Eternity Cache anywhere with one affix choice per Legendary Potential, change affix tiers in place, spawn any base item, Unique or Set, or a base item, idol (Omen idols too) or idol altar with the affixes you choose.[/*]
[*][b]Character:[/b] customize your character stats.[/*]
[*][b]Wardrobe:[/b] click any look and your character wears it at once, in a live mirror: every base item, Unique and Set of your gear's type, with the game's own pictures (transmog, display only).[/*]
[*][b]Skills, Equipment, Summons:[/b] skill points, tree connections, the skills of your class's other masteries, offhand and set rules, any number of primordial items, gear above your level, minions, minions without acceleration, free respec.[/*]
[*][b]Hideout (alpha):[/b] your own hideout: place anything of the game where you want it with an editor, ready designs and templates, its own minimap, a door for each timeline's boss, Boss Rush through all ten, Empowered and Harbinger, your stash, a vendor and the Eternity Cache. F6 > Hideout, or the house button under the minimap.[/*]
[*][b]Inventory:[/b] quad stash tabs (24 x 34, four times the items, chosen in the game's Configure Tab window), extra inventory and idol pages with every idol page counting at once, all idol slots open.[/*]
[*][b]Campaign, Monolith, Circle of Fortune:[/b] finish the campaign (raise to level 55 or keep your current level, even level 1), waypoints, character level, timelines, Corruption, Stability, skip quest echoes, no blessing window, prophecies.[/*]
[*][b]Unique Atlas and Stash Assistant:[/b] your collection, missing items and duplicates.[/*]
[*][b]Combat:[/b] stack cap and duration of the ailments you and your minions apply, damage window and death recap.[/*]
[*]Display and camera options, English / Turkish / Russian.[/*]
[/list]

[size=5][b]Safety[/b][/size]
VirusTotal (8 November 2026): version.dll [b]0/71[/b], ZIP holds this same version.dll and text files. Windows Defender: no threats. Each file's SHA-256 is listed in the ZIP (SHA256SUMS.txt). Scan results are not a guarantee; report any warning with the file name.

[size=5][b]Credits and support[/b][/size]
Made by Falor. Unofficial community mod, not affiliated with Eleventh Hour Games. Made with AI assistance. No game files or saves are included.
[url=https://discord.gg/q6aexZZSAf]Discord support[/url] | [url=https://github.com/falorfrozen-cmd/EpochPact]GitHub[/url]
When reporting a problem, please include the EpochPact version, what you did and a screenshot.
